  "description": "The Rover is our take on what a modern gravel bike should be: fast when you want it, comfortable when you need it, and capable enough to keep exploring when the pavement ends. Built around progressive gravel geometry and a dialed carbon layup, the Rover delivers a smooth, confident ride over long miles and mixed terrain. It feels equally at home on pavement, rough dirt roads, rolling singletrack, and everything in between.\n\nThe Rover blends efficiency with real versatility. A compliant carbon frame and fork help take the edge off long rides, while modern gravel geometry keeps handling stable, comfortable, and fast.\n\nMultiple mounts for bottles and gear make it easy to go long, and dropper post compatibility adds confidence when the route turns technical. With updated builds and 45mm tires spec'd, the Rover is ready for everything from gravel racing to weekend overnighters.",
